[{"op":"choice","id":"1009:4016180","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"捉弄她","value":0,"serial":4016180},{"text":"还是算了","value":1,"serial":4016190}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":6,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":5,"condition":["==",["v","f",114],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要不试试给她吃早苗阿姨的面包…。"},{"op":"goto","to":210},{"op":"goto","to":11},{"op":"ifFalse","to":11,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还是边睡边等吧…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我放着风子没管，再次躺了下来。"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",115],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟不是在学校，恐怕没那么得心应手…。"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9070,"entry":0},{"op":"dynamicChoice","id":"1009:button:2240","target":["v","f",1089],"labels":[["v","s",1011],["v","s",1012],["v","s",1013],["v","s",1014],"给她吃早苗阿姨的面包"]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":75,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":20,"condition":["==",["v","f",100],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（让她用鼻子喝饮料已经玩腻了…换个别的吧…）"},{"op":"goto","to":13},{"op":"goto","to":74},{"op":"ifFalse","to":53,"condition":["==",["v","f",100],1]},{"op":"background","image":"bg007n1"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我向正在打样的大叔打了声招呼，买了一盒橙汁。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg002n1"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"拿着橙汁回到客厅。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu34a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（这次一定要成功…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将饮料的吸管插进风子的鼻孔。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（好…开始吧…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嘿！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一鼓作气，挤压饮料盒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哧溜！"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「唔唔ーー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风子回过神来。我赶紧向后一跳拉开距离，装作没事人一般。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那么…结果如何呢…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「鼻子又感觉怪怪的了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「哧，哧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她像之前一样擤着鼻子。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu30a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「唔ー，鼻子好痒，但什么都擤不出来。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「而且不知为什么，喉咙里润润的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…成功了…终于让她喝下去了。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1015],"value":"『让风子用鼻子喝饮料』登峰造极了！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9070,"entry":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",124],"value":["+",["v","f",124],1]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",100],"value":2},{"op":"goto","to":74},{"op":"ifFalse","to":74,"condition":["==",["v","f",100],0]},{"op":"background","image":"bg007n1"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我向正在打样的大叔打了声招呼，买了一盒橙汁。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg002n1"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu34a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我买完饮料回来，将饮料的吸管头插进了风子毫无防备的鼻孔里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"噗。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「哇…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不小心没收住，插太深了…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回过神来的风子跳着往后退去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（可惜…失败了…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「鼻子感觉怪怪的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「哧，哧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她拼命地在擤着鼻子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而她不可能擤得出东西来。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",100],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":285},{"op":"ifFalse","to":154,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":78,"condition":["==",["v","f",101],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（这里毕竟不是学校，说不定能找到新地方…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我环抱住风子将她拉了起来，然后拖着她走了出去。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg006n1"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（摆在哪儿好呢…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（早苗阿姨和＄渚的房间感觉不太合适…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（那就这里吧…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看见大叔多次进出过这个走廊尽头的房间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也想像不到里面会是什么样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"微微拉开门，将风子推进去后立马将门关上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「哇ー！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回过神来的风子冲了出来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「刚刚，风子去到了一个奇怪的地方！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么了？出什么事了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「风子被震撼到了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「说清楚点，到底怎么回事？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「那是…极度危险的房间！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你们俩在别人房间前吵什么呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"身为房间主人的大叔在走廊另一头瞪着我们。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「唉…这里是秋生叔叔的房间吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「是啊。怎么了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听到这个回答后，风子连忙跑开，背靠着走廊尽头的角落。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「她这是怎么了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「从我的经验上来看，她应该是觉得自己藏起来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「可看起来她只是躲在墙角而已。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「嘶ー。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小动物的恐吓声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嗯？我哪里得罪她了吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「似乎是在你房间里看见了什么恐怖的东西。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「房间里？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「哦…你看见那个了吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔遗憾地摇了摇头。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",327],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「风子…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「忘掉吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「那是你永远无法理解的世界。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「答应我，忘掉你所看见的一切…坚强地活下去。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完这些，大叔便转过身去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「大叔，到底是什么啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔扭过脸来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「男人的浪漫…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"留下这简简单单的一句话后，便默默走开。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「男人的浪漫？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「风子，你到底看见什么了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我回过头来，朝依旧躲在墙角的风子询问后，风子只是默默地指了指大叔的房间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"似乎是让我自己去看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好吧…我知道了。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",327],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我小心翼翼地靠近房门，握住把手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘎吱…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"门渐渐打开了…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"印入我眼帘的是…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"整整一墙的…机动战士模型。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":153,"condition":["<",["v","f",101],2]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",101],"value":["+",["v","f",101],1]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":153,"condition":["==",["v","f",101],2]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1015],"value":"『把风子丢到别的地方』登峰造极了！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9070,"entry":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",124],"value":["+",["v","f",124],1]},{"op":"goto","to":285},{"op":"ifFalse","to":159,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"遗憾的是没人能配合。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（还是换一个吧…）"},{"op":"goto","to":13},{"op":"goto","to":285},{"op":"ifFalse","to":208,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],3]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":163,"condition":["==",["v","f",104],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（我已经想不到点子了…还是换一个吧…）"},{"op":"goto","to":13},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把风子小心翼翼抱在怀里的星形雕刻用力抽了出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后脱下她的室内鞋，让她拿在手里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后再等了一会儿。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「哈…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你总算醒过来了，我等了好久。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「嗯？请不要说得像风子刚才在发呆一样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你刚才本来就在发呆。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「风子，根本没有在发呆。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「严格说来，就像掠食的野兽一样全神贯注。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那你大概会在不知不觉间被猎物给吃掉。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「这世上没有那么蠢的野兽。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「行行行，总之我明白你是有多喜欢那东西了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「你现在才明白吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，家家必备的珍宝。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「竟然理解得这么透彻吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以，你能不能亲它一下？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「亲一晚上都行。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「亲亲，亲亲。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「喂，风子为什么在亲拖鞋啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我以为你挺喜欢它的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「这怎么可能，风子深受打击！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「哎…明明只亲过海星…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「亲吻史为海星…还有海星…以及海星…这时突然穿插了一个拖鞋进来你不觉得很奇怪吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我觉得亲海星就已经很奇怪了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「太过于少女情怀了吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu30"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「如果是的话，那风子无言以对。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我根本什么都没说。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",104],"value":["+",["v","f",104],1]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":207,"condition":["==",["v","f",104],2]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1015],"value":"『替换怀中的雕刻』登峰造极了！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9070,"entry":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",124],"value":["+",["v","f",124],1]},{"op":"goto","to":285},{"op":"ifFalse","to":285,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],4]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早苗阿姨的面包吗…。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg007n1"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我下楼来到一楼店面。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak20e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「别挡道，闪一边去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我想要点面包。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「哼…来捡卖剩下的面包么…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「也没见你平时来买过…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不行吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「…随你便了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「谢啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在征得同意之后，我开始在架子上挑选起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"很快就找到了心仪的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和其他面包完全不同的色调。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其名为彩虹面包。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"名副其实，面包上延伸着七彩的线条…诡异得让人望而却步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且还附着写有『热卖中！』的标签。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这是骗人的吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「别说得那么难听，这叫希望。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「寄托着古河面包店未来的希望…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这个希望在店内已经堆积如山了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想不到任何安慰的话语。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「难不成你让我照实写跪求买一个吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我又没有吐槽…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我默默拿起了一个希望…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak22e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「赐予你…彩虹。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔留下这句神秘的话后就走进了厨房。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也决定回房间。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg002n1"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu34a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风子依旧处于神游状态。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我蹲在她面前，将彩虹面包撕成小块。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后用手指捏住她的下巴往下一拉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小嘴张了开来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「赐予你彩虹。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘴里念叨着这句神秘话语，同时将面包块塞进她的嘴里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后抬起她的下巴，让她咀嚼。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咀嚼…咀嚼…咀嚼…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「呜…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「呜呜呜…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"痛苦地呻吟起来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「唔ー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"猛地拍开我的手，站起身来跑了出去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"结果狠狠地撞在墙上，随之倒地。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「坏了…玩大了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「真不该用人类来试验！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「咳咳…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「冈崎同学…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她艰难地撑起上身然后看向我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「风子好像吃了奇怪的东西…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那…味道如何…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「惨…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「惨得空前绝后…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"扑通一声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再次倒地不起。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":290,"condition":["==",["v","f",124],4]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1015],"value":"你已成为『风子使』！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9070,"entry":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…容我婉拒。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",125],"value":1},{"op":"return"},{"op":"return"}]